<Career id="ARCH3-WORK99">
<Description language="ENGLISH">"Priest of Handrich"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"You follow the ways of Handrich, always looking for the best deal in the transcendental pursuit of profit. Though not as common as other cults, Handrichan priests are sought after for their financial sense and discretion. Many do preach sermons, teaching Handrich’s tenets of self-reliance and the glories of material wealth, but they more often serve in private capacities, overseeing transactions to ensure honesty or offering financial advice. Most tend to temples found in large trading centres, or join caravans and trade expeditions as part of their service to Handrich."</Explanation>
<Skill>"RULES-COMPMARCH"</Skill>
<Class>"CLASS_ACAD"</Class>
