<Career id="ARCH3-WORK101">
<Description language="ENGLISH">"Priest of Rhya"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"You are a vessel for the Earth Mother’s wishes and blessings amongst the mortals who depend on her benefucence for comfort and survival. Priestesses of Rhya live amongst the common folk. They wander  between farms, villages, and sacred sites, talking with people, offering blessings, and keeping a close eye on the land and the pastoral care of their flock. People depend on them to stave off famine, bring new life into the world, and give practical advice on love and matters of the family."</Explanation>
<Skill>"RULES-COMPPRIERE"</Skill>
<Class>"CLASS_ACAD"</Class>
